    srb-legal-rag benchmark question sets, Ratko Nikolić, CC BY 4.0.
    https://github.com/RatkoNikolic/srb-legal-rag

Note on the underlying statutes
-------------------------------

The gold answers quote and cite Serbian statutory law. Statute text is excluded
from copyright under Zakon o autorskom i srodnim pravima čl. 6 and is therefore
not subject to this or any license. What is licensed here is the original
material: the question set, the authored answers, the selection and arrangement
of citations, and the difficulty and capability labels.

The software in this repository is licensed separately, under Apache-2.0 — see
the LICENSE file at the repository root.
